いる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人からは距離を置きがちだが、実は恥ずかしがり屋で根は優しい娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがその性格の裏には破滅願望が強く、SM禁止法法案を推進した父・愛国を破滅させてやりたいと思っている節が時々見え隠れする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、精液を飲むことが死ぬほど苦手。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9210","sourceWorkId":"16340","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/acfbe86f56a871694c2320c4b8fd574a143ebce58b6214287809a083d6539dd6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b0dc17ae3b53f69d19b479dd03cc96b99dc55e7363c76c865f64f4e6fa8a91e.webp","width":90,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41090:33818:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25994","characterName":"有栖","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48600","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41090"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9209"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25994"},"originalCharacterName":"有栖","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cute girl Yuria encounters at a bus stop near Seirei Gakuen. She has a pretty face, does cute gestures, wears maid clothes, and has even mastered the art of doing a small bow while lightly picking the ends of her skirt with both hands."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Alice is a huge masochist who especially loves it when people bully or yell at her. Adding to this, she is a pervert who loves the smell of Yuria's crotch so much she'd want to use it as her pillow for the rest of her life. Due to the aforementioned facts everybody avoids and feels uncomfortable around Alice at school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25994"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"百合亜が誠憐学園付近のバス停で出会う可憐な子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人形のような顔立ちに可愛らしい仕草、そのうえメイド服を着用しており、「わたくしは、令嬢のためのメイドです」 と、スカートの端を両手で軽く摘み会釈するポーズがよく似合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はマゾヒストであり、苛められたり罵られることに異常な性的興奮を感じてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに百合亜の股間の臭いがとても好きらしく、一生自分の顔を座布団代わりにしてほしいと心から思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性癖のため学園内ではみんな有栖を気持ち悪がって、誰も近寄ろうともしないのが現状。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9209","sourceWorkId":"16340","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"百合亜が誠憐学園付近のバス停で出会う可憐な子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人形のような顔立ちに可愛らしい仕草、そのうえメイド服を着用しており、「わたくしは、令嬢のためのメイドです」 と、スカートの端を両手で軽く摘み会釈するポーズがよく似合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はマゾヒストであり、いじめられたり罵られることに異常な性的興奮を感じてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに百合亜の股間の臭いがとても好きらしく、一生自分の顔を座布団代わりにしてほしいと心から思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性癖のため学園内ではみんな有栖を気持ち悪がって、誰も近寄ろうともしないのが現状。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わたくしは……貴方の奴隷になりたいと、願いました」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48600"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/4756311840b389ae4bbc9369755c94d191a97db89ad13f839ca774a41bdbac3b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c709320d391c26f72c7961807675fc1922296d01c0ae5da9d0f722fec69bf0c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羽月理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s928","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s928","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s928","name":"羽月 理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41090:48600:5907:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c40908","characterName":"花園 桔梗","sourceIds":{